    "description": "Conquer the terrain with the Salomon XT-WHISPER. Rooted in the legendary XT lineage, these sneakers blend a provocatively textured upper with a modern wavy SensiFit design for a secure foothold. The play on matte and shiny finishes adds depth, while the Agile Chassis System provides the stability and dampening needed for every stride. Step into heritage performance with the Salomon XT-WHISPER.3D open mesh upper provides maximum breathabilitySensiFit cradles the foot for a virtually customized fitQuicklace system ensures a snug and impeccable holdAnti-debris tongue offers an extra level of protectionAgile Chassis System works with the EnergyCell midsole for stabilityLugged rubber outsole delivers reliable tractionMaterial & CareTextile and synthetic upperRubber outsoleSize & FitLow-top activewear silhouetteFlexible insole for comfortable movementArch support for all-day wearability",
